#: ../../backups/summary.rst:2
msgid "Summary"
msgstr "Resumen"

#: ../../backups/summary.rst:4
msgid "The Backups Summary section shows the following metrics:"
msgstr "La sección de Resumen de Backups muestra las siguientes métricas:"

#: ../../backups/summary.rst:6
msgid ""
"Open this view from :menuselection:`Backups --> Summary`. Use "
":menuselection:`Backups --> Jobs` for scheduled definitions and "
":menuselection:`Backups --> History` for execution and restore results."
msgstr "Abra esta vista desde :menuselection:`Backups --> Summary`. Use :menuselection:`Backups --> Jobs` para definiciones programadas y :menuselection:`Backups --> History` para resultados de ejecución y restauración."

#: ../../backups/summary.rst:8
msgid "Number of Configured Backups trend"
msgstr "Tendencia del número de Backups configurados"

#: ../../backups/summary.rst:9
msgid "Backup Success Rate"
msgstr "Tasa de éxito de Backup"

#: ../../backups/summary.rst:10
msgid "Number of Completed Backups"
msgstr "Número de Backups completados"

#: ../../backups/summary.rst:11
msgid "Number of Failed Backups"
msgstr "Número de Backups fallidos"

#: ../../backups/summary.rst:12
msgid "Total Size of Backups (MB) trend"
msgstr "Tendencia del tamaño total de Backups (MB)"

#: ../../backups/summary.rst:13
msgid "Upcoming and In Progress Backups"
msgstr "Backups próximos y en progreso"

#: ../../backups/summary.rst:15
msgid ""
"If a User's Role permission for Backups is set to `User`, the user will "
"only see metrics for backups they own."
msgstr ""
"Si el permiso de Rol de un usuario para Backups está configurado como "
"`User`, el usuario solo verá métricas de los backups que posee."

